d 'POLYPML': module to perform Joint estimation of polychoric correlations and thresholds with missing data: pairwise maximum likelihood or full-information maximum likelihood
d
d     polycorr estimates each correlation by the two-step method.
d Thresholds come from the margins and each correlation from its
d own	 pair, using listwise or pairwise deletion. polypml instead
d estimates all thresholds and correlations jointly, using every   
d observed value. 
d
d KW: polychoric correlations
d KW: full-information maximum likelihood
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261030
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f polypml.ado
f polypml.sthlp
f polypml_examples.do
f polypml_cert.do
